{"id":"a8b8a34e241cffe0","group":"68","path":"68/68-cor-numerical-projective-relations.md","title":"Pure Number Relations Have Real Parameters","display":"cor-numerical-projective-relations — Pure Number Relations Have Real Parameters","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-cor-numerical-projective-relations","aliases":["68-cor-numerical-projective-relations"],"display":"cor-numerical-projective-relations — Pure Number Relations Have Real Parameters","depends_on":["[[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]","[[68-df-borel-relation]]","[[68-thm-suslin-theorem]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§20 p.76 / PDF 85, parenthetical remark after 20.1","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-remark-and-local-coding-proof-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-cor-numerical-projective-relations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-cor-numerical-projective-relations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-numerical-projective-relations — Pure Number Relations Have Real Parameters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"150b567749c83f49\" href=\"?note=150b567749c83f49\" title=\"68-df-projective-hierarchy\">68-df-projective-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"61df304a04864967\" href=\"?note=61df304a04864967\" title=\"68-df-borel-relation\">68-df-borel-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53a901d3f85d3dac\" href=\"?note=53a901d3f85d3dac\" title=\"68-thm-suslin-theorem\">68-thm-suslin-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§20 p.76 / PDF 85, parenthetical remark after 20.1"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-remark-and-local-coding-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{0,k}=\\mathcal B^0\\times\\mathbb N^k\">\\(X_{0,k}=\\mathcal B^0\\times\\mathbb N^k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\mathbb N^k\\)</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((),\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\vec x\">\\(((),\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\vec x\\)</span> 识别。粗体类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"150b567749c83f49\" href=\"?note=150b567749c83f49\" title=\"68-df-projective-hierarchy\">68-df-projective-hierarchy</a>，Borel 类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"61df304a04864967\" href=\"?note=61df304a04864967\" title=\"68-df-borel-relation\">68-df-borel-relation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(0,k)}=\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(0,k)}=\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(0,k)}=\\mathrm{Borel}^{(0,k)}=\\mathcal P(X_{0,k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(0,k)}=\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(0,k)}=\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(0,k)}=\\mathrm{Borel}^{(0,k)}=\\mathcal P(X_{0,k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书提醒每个纯数关系都递归于全实数类。对有限 k，递归编码自然数元组，用一个实数记录任意关系的特征函数即得带实参数的递归定义，故位于各正投射层。另 X_{0,k} 可数且每个单点都是递归关系，任意子集是可数个单点的并，故为 Borel；k=0 时 X 只有空元组，仍成立。这不表示无参数的算术/解析层级坍缩。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-projective-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"150b567749c83f49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-borel-relation","status":"resolved","id":"61df304a04864967","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-borel-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-suslin-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"53a901d3f85d3dac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-suslin-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-projective-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"150b567749c83f49","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$。$X_{0,k}=\\mathcal B^0\\times\\mathbb N^k$ 与 $\\mathbb N^k$ 通过 $((),\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\vec x$ 识别。粗体类见 [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]，Borel 类见 [[68-df-borel-relation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-borel-relation","status":"resolved","id":"61df304a04864967","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$。$X_{0,k}=\\mathcal B^0\\times\\mathbb N^k$ 与 $\\mathbb N^k$ 通过 $((),\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\vec x$ 识别。粗体类见 [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]，Borel 类见 [[68-df-borel-relation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"X_{0,k}=\\mathcal B^0\\times\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"((),\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(0,k)}=\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(0,k)}=\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(0,k)}=\\mathrm{Borel}^{(0,k)}=\\mathcal P(X_{0,k}).","display":true}],"bytes":1635,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-cor-numerical-projective-relations]] — corollary"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-cor-numerical-projective-relations|cor-numerical-projective-relations — Pure Number Relations Have Real Parameters]]"}],"outgoing":["150b567749c83f49","61df304a04864967","53a901d3f85d3dac"]}